WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.436
Pages, articles, and blogs on an Orchard Core site are content items.

00:00:05.436 --> 00:00:09.813
In this video, you create a content item, publish it, change it, and

00:00:09.813 --> 00:00:12.830
take it off your site, all from the admin UI.

00:00:17.430 --> 00:00:21.314
A content item is one piece of content on your site, such as

00:00:21.314 --> 00:00:23.432
an article, a page, or a blog.

00:00:23.432 --> 00:00:28.610
Each one follows a content type, which defines what that kind of content contains.

00:00:29.360 --> 00:00:33.545
A content type is made of parts and fields, such as a title,

00:00:33.545 --> 00:00:36.209
a permalink, a body, and a subtitle.

00:00:36.209 --> 00:00:42.170
Its settings, Creatable, Listable, and Draftable, decide whether you can create items of

00:00:42.170 --> 00:00:44.960
that type, list them, and save drafts.

00:00:45.710 --> 00:00:48.751
A content item moves through a life cycle.

00:00:48.751 --> 00:00:51.982
A draft is saved, but visitors cannot see it.

00:00:51.982 --> 00:00:58.380
Publishing makes it visible on your site, unpublishing hides it again, and deleting removes it.

00:00:59.130 --> 00:01:02.183
What you see depends on your role's permissions.

00:01:02.183 --> 00:01:06.988
Edit content for others shows Edit and Save Draft, Publish or unpublish content

00:01:06.988 --> 00:01:12.020
for others shows Publish and Unpublish, and Delete content for others shows Delete.

00:01:12.770 --> 00:01:16.848
Each of these also has an own content permission, such as Edit own

00:01:16.848 --> 00:01:19.680
content, which applies to the items you own.

00:01:23.949 --> 00:01:27.447
In the admin menu, open Content, then Content Items.

00:01:27.447 --> 00:01:29.860
The page is titled Manage Content.

00:01:29.860 --> 00:01:35.709
It lists the items of every listable content type, starting with the ones you changed last.

00:01:36.210 --> 00:01:40.575
Each row shows the title, the content type, the status, and how long

00:01:40.575 --> 00:01:42.167
ago the item changed.

00:01:42.167 --> 00:01:46.650
Edit opens the editor, and View opens the published page on your site.

00:01:47.105 --> 00:01:52.004
As the list grows, the Search box and the Filters menu narrow it down.

00:01:52.004 --> 00:01:55.485
A separate video covers searching and filtering.

00:01:55.938 --> 00:01:58.962
To add content, click New and choose a content type.

00:01:58.962 --> 00:02:02.665
The menu only offers the types that the site lets you create, and

00:02:02.665 --> 00:02:04.438
that your permissions allow.

00:02:08.687 --> 00:02:11.247
On the list, click New, then Article.

00:02:11.247 --> 00:02:15.711
The page is titled New Article, and the editor shows what the Article

00:02:15.711 --> 00:02:17.497
content type is made of.

00:02:18.045 --> 00:02:20.549
Enter the title Spring Garden Checklist.

00:02:20.549 --> 00:02:23.107
The Permalink is the address of the page.

00:02:23.107 --> 00:02:28.005
Leave it empty, and Orchard Core generates it from the title when you save the item.

00:02:28.565 --> 00:02:32.303
Write the body in the rich text editor, then add a subtitle.

00:02:32.303 --> 00:02:35.475
Banner Image is optional, so let's leave it empty.

00:02:35.960 --> 00:02:39.584
At the bottom of the page, Save Draft stores the item as a

00:02:39.584 --> 00:02:41.679
draft that visitors cannot see.

00:02:41.679 --> 00:02:44.170
Publish makes it visible on your site.

00:02:44.673 --> 00:02:48.978
The arrow beside each button opens one more choice, "and continue".

00:02:48.978 --> 00:02:53.343
Choosing it saves or publishes the item and keeps you in the editor,

00:02:53.343 --> 00:02:55.643
instead of returning to the list.

00:02:56.170 --> 00:02:57.483
Let's click Publish.

00:02:57.483 --> 00:03:01.521
A message confirms that the Article has been published, and the list shows

00:03:01.521 --> 00:03:03.590
the item with the status Published.

00:03:07.852 --> 00:03:12.269
To see the result, use the View button on the row of Spring Garden Checklist.

00:03:12.269 --> 00:03:15.462
It opens the page on your site in another browser tab.

00:03:15.923 --> 00:03:17.729
This is what visitors see:

00:03:17.729 --> 00:03:20.211
the title, the subtitle, and the body.

00:03:20.211 --> 00:03:25.063
The address comes from the permalink that Orchard Core generated from the title.

00:03:29.287 --> 00:03:31.877
Back on the list, Edit opens the editor again.

00:03:31.877 --> 00:03:34.567
Let's add a sentence to the body of the article.

00:03:35.049 --> 00:03:36.107
Click Publish.

00:03:36.107 --> 00:03:39.335
A message confirms that the Article has been published.

00:03:39.335 --> 00:03:43.251
Save Draft would keep the change off your site until you publish it,

00:03:43.251 --> 00:03:46.109
and a separate video covers drafts and versions.

00:03:46.565 --> 00:03:50.595
Click View, and the page on your site shows the sentence you added.

00:03:54.851 --> 00:03:58.916
To take an item off your site, open the Actions menu of its

00:03:58.916 --> 00:04:00.292
row on the list.

00:04:00.292 --> 00:04:05.795
It offers Unpublish, Delete, and Clone, which saves a copy of the item as a draft.

00:04:05.795 --> 00:04:08.671
Choose Unpublish, then confirm with Yes.

00:04:09.156 --> 00:04:13.019
The item stays in the list with the status Draft, and visitors can

00:04:13.019 --> 00:04:14.628
no longer open its page.

00:04:14.628 --> 00:04:18.598
Publish Draft in the Actions menu, or Publish in the editor, puts it

00:04:18.598 --> 00:04:19.886
back on your site.

00:04:20.347 --> 00:04:24.981
To delete an item, click Edit, then Delete at the bottom of the editor.

00:04:24.981 --> 00:04:27.087
A dialog asks you to confirm.

00:04:27.543 --> 00:04:30.687
Click Ok, and the item disappears from the list.

00:04:30.687 --> 00:04:34.471
Delete is also in the Actions menu of a row, and deleting a

00:04:34.471 --> 00:04:37.673
published item removes it from your site as well.

00:04:39.673 --> 00:04:41.812
That's the life of a content item:

00:04:41.812 --> 00:04:45.554
you create it, publish it, change it, and take it off your site.

00:04:45.554 --> 00:04:46.943
Thanks for watching.

